    </span>
    <div class="xforms_title">
     <div>
      <span style="width:598px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;">기타시장안내</span>
     </div>
    </div>
    <span class="noprint" style="display:none;width:600px;font-size:10pt;">
    </span>
    <table border="1" borderColorDark="white" borderColorLight="#666666" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="0" id="XFormD26_Form0_Table0" style="margin:0px 0px 20px 0px;width:600px;font-size:10pt;border:1px solid #7f7f7f;">
     <tbody>
      <tr>
       <td width="221">
        <span style="width:221px;font-size:10pt;">1. 제목</span>
       </td>
       <td colspan="2" width="379">
        <span class="xforms_input" style="width:379px;font-size:10pt;">업종변경 안내</span>
       </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
       <td width="221">
        <span style="width:221px;font-size:10pt;">2. 내용</span>
       </td>
       <td colspan="2" width="379">
        <span class="xforms_input" style="width:379px;font-size:10pt;">통계청의 한국표준산업분류 개정(2017.7.1 시행)에 따라 동사의 업종이 다음과 같이 변경됨을 안내합니다.
         <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"/>
         <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"/>1. 회사명 : 두산밥캣(주)
         <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"/>
         <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"/>2. 변경전 업종 및 코드
         <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"/><?javax.xml.transform.disable-output-escaping?>&nbsp;<?javax.xml.transform.enable-output-escaping?>&nbsp; (대분류) 전문, 과학 및 기술 서비스업 (13)
         <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"/><?javax.xml.transform.disable-output-escaping?>&nbsp;<?javax.xml.transform.enable-output-escaping?>&nbsp; (중분류) 전문서비스업 (71)
         <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"/><?javax.xml.transform.disable-output-escaping?>&nbsp;<?javax.xml.transform.enable-output-escaping?>&nbsp; (소분류) 회사본부, 지주회사 및 경영컨설팅 서비스업(05)
         <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"/>
         <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"/>3. 변경후 업종 및 코드
         <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"/><?javax.xml.transform.disable-output-escaping?>&nbsp;<?javax.xml.transform.enable-output-escaping?>&nbsp; (대분류) 금융 및 보험업 (11)
         <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"/><?javax.xml.transform.disable-output-escaping?>&nbsp;<?javax.xml.transform.enable-output-escaping?>&nbsp; (중분류) 금융업 (64)
         <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"/><?javax.xml.transform.disable-output-escaping?>&nbsp;<?javax.xml.transform.enable-output-escaping?>&nbsp; (소분류) 기타 금융업 (09)
         <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"/><?javax.xml.transform.disable-output-escaping?>&nbsp;<?javax.xml.transform.enable-output-escaping?>&nbsp;
         <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"/>4. 변경일 : 2017-07-03
         <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"/>
         <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"/>5. 변경사유 : 한국표준산업분류 기준 변경
         <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"/>
         <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"/>6. 근거규정 : 유가증권시장 상장규정 시행세칙 제132조
         <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"/>
         <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"/>
         <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"/>(한국거래소)</span>
       </td>
